'''Centre Cívico''' ({{Literal translation|Civic Center}}; {{Langx|mxi|سِينْتْرِي سِِيبِيكُو |Séntre Síbiko}}) is a [[Communes of Balisca|barrio]] located in the [[Sástago]] borough of [[Castejón]]. It is the seat of the [[Castejón#Administration and politics|metropolitan (regional) government]], while [[Confederal government of Balisca|confederal institutions]] are concentrated in neighboring [[Hisbanya]]. 

